      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有些寶可夢的性格\n是會提升速度的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67094E9B5BF653EF592276846027683C000A662F670363D05347901F5EA67684300200100002011401E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "急躁是當然會，\n膽小、爽朗和天真也會。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60258E81662F757671366703FF0C000A81BD5C0F3001723D6717548C5929771F4E5F6703300200100002011401E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而且速度越快，\n使出招式為止的時間也會越短。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 828,
